  </head>
  <body>
    <a class="skip" href="#main">Skip to content</a>
    <header><a href="/">SayPay <span>W1</span></a><span>PayPal sandbox · test money only</span></header>
    <main id="main"><slot /></main>
    <footer>Manual payment-chain verification. AI parsing and the product confirmation card are later stages.</footer>
  </body>
</html>
